===Etymology===
[[File:Einstein 1933.jpg|thumb|{{w|Albert Einstein}} in 1933]]

From {{m|en|Einstein}}, the surname of {{w|Albert Einstein}} (1879–1955) {{suffix|en||ian|t2=''suffix forming adjectives or nouns meaning ‘belonging to, relating to, or like’''}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|RP|GA}} {{IPA|/aɪnˈstaɪ.nɪ.ən/|lang=en}}
* {{hyphenation|Ein|stein|i|an|lang=en}}

